{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-06T16:58:39+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-06T16:58:39+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"X-FAB Silicon Foundries SE","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"Belgium","city":"Tessenderlo","website":"https://www.xfab.com","employees":4000,"summary":"X-FAB Silicon Foundries SE develops, produces, and sells analog/mixed-signal IC, micro-electro-mechanical systems, and silicon photonics products for automotive, medical, industrial, communication, and consumer sectors in the Europe, the United States, Asia, and internationally. The company offers silicon carbide and gallium nitride; avalanche photodiodes and single-photon avalanche diodes; gas and flow, image, inertial, pressure, photodiodes, and temperature sensors. It also provides wafer fabrication, design support and IP libraries, customer-specific technologies development; non-recurring engineering and technology; outsourcing and fab transfers services. X-FAB Silicon Foundries SE was founded in 1992 and is based in Tessenderlo, Belgium.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"X-FAB Silicon Foundries SE développe, produit et vend des circuits intégrés analogiques/à signaux mixtes, des systèmes microélectromécaniques et des produits photoniques en silicium pour les secteurs de l'automobile, du médical, de l'industrie, de la communication et de la consommation en Europe, aux États-Unis, en Asie et à l'international. La société propose du carbure de silicium et du nitrure de gallium; des photodiodes à avalanche et des diodes à avalanche monophotoniques; des capteurs de gaz et de flux, d'image, d'inertie, de pression, de photodiodes et de température. Il fournit également la fabrication de plaquettes, le support de conception et les bibliothèques IP, le développement de technologies spécifiques au client; ingénierie et technolo